{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4ad5e6f0-8f4c-887c-ad79-0a66d728d8f8",
  "created_at": "2025-12-30T09:52:11-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rocco Ricci",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:48:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:48:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah. My trash didn't get picked up. It's supposed to go out on Monday, and it's still sitting at the curb this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:48:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Monday pickup. What's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:48:50-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "76 Gidley Street. It's in the Fifth Ward, up past where the old market used to be. Well, it's a laundromat now, but you know what I mean."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:49:03-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 76 Gidley. Let me write that down. And the barrels were out on the curb Monday morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:49:12-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. I put them out Sunday night, same as always. Both the trash and the recycling bin. The recycling got taken, I think. The bin's empty. But the trash barrels are still full."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:49:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hm, so recycling went but not the trash. Okay. Was there a tag or a sticker on the barrel, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:49:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, nothing on it. I looked. No tag, no note."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:49:43-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Let me pull up the route here. [pause] Okay, so the holiday week can throw things off a little. Christmas fell on Thursday, so some routes slid by a day, and some crews are running behind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:50:00-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, I figured it might be something like that. So when's the next pickup for me? Do I just leave it out, or do I pull it back in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:50:14-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd leave it at the curb. I'm going to note it as a missed pickup for your address, and they'll try to get it on the route. Your regular day is Monday, so the next one would be Monday the fifth. But I'll send this over so they can see if a crew can swing by sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:50:40-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Because the thing is, I work for a place that closes early on Fridays this season, so I'm home a bit Friday afternoon. If they come then, I can bring the barrels in. Otherwise I'm gone most days till late."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:50:59-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so Friday afternoon you'd be around. I'll put that in the notes. I can't promise they'll come Friday, though. It depends on how the crews are doing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:51:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, no, that's fine. I just want to know whether to leave it out all week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:51:20-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Leave it out, lid closed, and keep it off the sidewalk if you can. If it's not picked up by Monday the fifth, call back and we'll look at it again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:51:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Should I give you a number in case they have questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:51:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:51:43-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0194."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:51:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0194. Got it. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:51:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Rocco Ricci. R-I-C-C-I."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:51:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Rocco Ricci, 76 Gidley, missed trash Monday, recycling collected, Friday afternoon available. That's everything I have."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:51:59-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:52:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Have a good one, and happy new year in case I don't talk to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T09:52:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
